WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.770
Catarina Claes,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:08.270
we are going to expose all of the evil 
deeds you have committed, here and now!

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.460
<i>Evil deeds? Me?</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.700
Wait, like what?

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>Do they mean when I throw toy snakes?</i>

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:20.000
<i>Or did they find out I started 
a farm on school grounds?</i>

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.410
<i>Otherwise, there's... uh...</i>

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.490
You have flaunted your position

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.760
as a duke's daughter 
and Prince Geordo's fiancée

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.990
to tyrannize those of 
lower status than yourself!

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:34.500
And your jealousy toward the light magic 
user Maria Campbell because of her closeness

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.180
to Prince Geordo and his friends

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:38.800
has led you to bully her in ways 
that border on criminal!

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:43.330
<i>What? This all sounds familiar...</i>

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.230
<i>I remember now!</i>

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:49.820
has led you to bully her in ways

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:47.230
<i>I saw it over and over in the game!</i>

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.810
<i>It's Catarina Claes's judgment event!</i>

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:56.780
<i>After having her crimes exposed 
in front of everyone, just like this,</i>

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:00.990
<i>Catarina is led toward her doom ending!</i>

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:04.410
<i>I can't believe it's happening now!</i>

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:07.760
<i>But wait... the ones who judged Catarina</i>

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:09.870
<i>were the conquerable characters.</i>

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:12.220
<i>In Geordo's route, Geordo did it,</i>

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:14.120
<i>and in Keith's route, Keith did it.</i>

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:17.330
<i>They took a stand to 
protect Maria, I thought...</i>

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:20.110
Wait, what?

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:21.620
Don't bother playing dumb!

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:24.150
We have concrete proof right here!

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:26.760
This is a record of all the harassment

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:31.890
Catarina Claes has subjected Maria Campbell 
to, complete with evidence.

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:35.780
I saw you bullying her 
with my own eyes lots of times!

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:44.950
What is this all about?

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:47.960
Prince Geordo!

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:49.960
Just look at this!

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:03.860
<i>This is exactly what happened 
in Catarina's judgment event in the game!</i>

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:07.720
<i>My doom flag finally found me!</i>

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:20.320
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess:
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:42.400
<b>Episode 10 
The Moment of My Doom Arrived... Part 1</b>

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:40.090
In the game's scenario,

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:42.890
Maria condemns Catarina right after this.

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:44.640
<i>What they say is true.</i>

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:48.480
If this plays out the same way, 
Catarina will be exiled all alone!

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:51.460
That or she'll be killed 
by the conquerable characters.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.600
Does she have a toy snake in her pocket?

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:58.010
If she's exiled, will she be able to 
take her favorite hoe with her?

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.550
Well, Maria Campbell...

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:05.310
Now is the time to prosecute 
Catarina Claes for her crimes!

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:09.440
All of this...

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.440
is complete rubbish!

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:17.620
Huh?

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:20.480
Please don't besmirch someone 
who means so much to me!

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:24.070
Wh-What are you talking about? 
We're doing this to help you!

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:26.930
Th-That's right. We have concrete proof!

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:29.000
We're all on your side!

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:30.860
Aren't we, Prince Geordo?

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:35.630
You call circumstantial evidence 
like this "concrete proof"?

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:37.050
Laughable.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:45.130
My simple-minded sister isn't even 
capable of such elaborate harassment.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:49.850
Did you really see my sister doing all this?

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.580
He's right!

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:55.780
There's no way Lady Catarina 
would do any of these things!

00:04:55.780 --> 00:04:58.320
She's far too simple-minded!

00:04:58.470 --> 00:05:00.250
Yeah, that's right.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:03.680
This idiot could never come up 
with such intricate schemes.

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:06.660
She's so dumb, all she could do 
would be to fight her head-on!

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:11.620
They're right! 
Lady Catarina isn't that clever!

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:12.910
Exactly.

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:15.620
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:18.840
<i>I think they're sticking up for me,</i>

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:20.290
<i>but I kind of feel insulted...</i>

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:23.600
It's true! Lady Catarina 
would never do such things!

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:25.300
This must be some kind of mistake.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:26.880
Yeah, that's right!

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.730
It's not possible!

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:32.290
It's true that I've

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:35.640
been bullied since I came here, 
just like these papers say.

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:39.140
But it wasn't Lady Catarina who bullied me.

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:43.100
Lady Catarina has stood up 
for me many times.

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:49.620
I clearly remember who it was 
that really bullied me.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:53.700
If it's what you want, I'd be glad 
to name them here and now.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:06.370
<i>What was that?</i>

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:09.650
Lady Catarina, are you all right?

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:11.620
Oh... Yeah.

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:14.460
Um, thanks, everyone.

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:19.120
No, we should apologize 
for not being here sooner to help you.

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:21.360
Sorry we were late, Sister.

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:25.530
<i>I can finally relax...</i>

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:32.570
I never expected those girls 
to do such a thing.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:36.660
I knew they had a grudge against my sister,

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:39.960
but I didn't think they 
were the type to act on it like that.

00:06:40.110 --> 00:06:43.580
Regardless of how she is, 
she is the daughter of a duke.

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:47.260
Slandering her could put 
them in a precarious position.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:52.930
Yes, and this list of "proof" doesn't look 
like something they could have come up with.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:56.900
Even if it's fake, it's very
competently put together.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:01.230
It's also strange that we were all 
called away on student council business.

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:05.700
It's as if they waited for a time 
when they knew we wouldn't be there.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:11.500
<i>Whew, thank goodness!</i>

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:13.620
<i>I made it through my judgment event!</i>

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:15.870
<i>I avoided my doom flags!</i>

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:25.420
<b>Doom</b>

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:25.420
<b>Doom
Flag</b>

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:19.410
<i>The story in the game continues 
until the current second-years graduate,</i>

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:21.740
<i>so I still can't let my guard down...</i>

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:25.420
<i>But still, I made it through my 
greatest crisis with all of their help!</i>

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:27.630
<i>What a relief!</i>

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:33.380
Ah, today's lunch was as tasty as ever!

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:37.340
I don't know how you could eat 
so much after what just happened.

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:39.420
That's part of what makes her so wonderful!

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:41.260
Thanks!

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:47.310
Um...

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:52.110
I'm sorry. You can all head back without me.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:55.700
I need to make a quick stop somewhere first.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:58.800
Where? Do you want us to go with you?

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:00.670
I mean, after that whole mess before...

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:05.040
No, it's nothing important. 
I'll be fine by myself.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:06.850
You can all go on ahead.

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:09.050
All right. We'll see you later, then.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:09.790
Okay.

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:16.650
<i>Later on, I would deeply regret</i>

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:20.600
<i>not going with Maria at that moment.</i>

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:23.860
<i>Our lunch break on that day...</i>

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:27.550
<i>was the last time any of us saw Maria.</i>

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:34.240
<b>Two Days Later</b>

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:40.960
<i>Why didn't I go with her?</i>

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.670
Warm yourself up with this.

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.270
You're rather pale.

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:47.550
President...

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:49.610
Thank you.

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:56.020
<i>The same gentle flavor as always...</i>

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:59.050
I'm sure Miss Maria is just fine.

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:01.090
Yes...

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:02.640
<i>The president...</i>

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:06.740
<i>He was good friends with Maria, too.</i>

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:11.060
<i>There's no way he isn't upset right now.</i>

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:14.300
<i>That's right.</i>

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:16.560
<i>I'm not the only one 
who's struggling with this.</i>

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:19.290
<i>I can't just sit around 
being sad and regretting it.</i>

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:22.940
All right! I'm going to find Maria!

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:25.260
Just stay safe and wait for me, Maria!

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:36.930
<i>But we couldn't find 
any trace of Maria at all.</i>

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:39.760
<i>We couldn't even find any clues.</i>

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:44.530
<i>It's been three days now...</i>

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:49.330
Lady Catarina, Prince Geordo is here.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.860
At this hour?

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:53.310
Did something happen to Maria?!

00:09:53.310 --> 00:09:57.180
No, I still haven't found out where she is,

00:09:57.180 --> 00:10:00.700
but I got some information 
that I must share with you.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.580
I'm sorry to come over so late.

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:04.010
Information?

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:09.190
First, take a look at the papers 
those girls presented as evidence.

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:14.160
I looked into it, and I 
learned something very strange.

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:17.160
It wasn't those girls 
that came up with that list.

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:19.700
Someone else put it together.

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:22.520
And what's even stranger is that

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:28.520
the girls have no recollection 
of who they got them from.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.610
They don't remember?

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:35.840
I thought they were lying, at first, 
so I checked into some things.

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:38.810
But it seems like they truly don't remember.

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:40.660
What could this mean?

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:44.330
Do they all have amnesia or something?

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:46.150
It's not only that.

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:51.460
They don't even remember why they tried 
to do what they did on that day.

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:56.340
It's true that they have 
unfavorable opinions of you,

00:10:56.700 --> 00:11:01.470
but they say they never even 
considered attempting anything

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.430
that would publicly damage you like that.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:04.940
For some reason,

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:08.860
I was suddenly overwhelmed 
with the urge to do something horrible

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:10.940
to that detestable Catarina Claes.

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:13.300
But when I left the cafeteria afterward,

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:16.000
that feeling had disappeared completely.

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:21.100
In fact, we're all at a loss 
as to why we did such a thing.

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:24.660
We're truly, truly sorry!

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:26.420
That's so strange.

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:29.580
It's as if someone was controlling them.

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:32.290
That may be exactly what happened.

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:37.080
The way those girls were acting 
at the time seemed very odd.

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:41.430
But how would someone 
manipulate them like that?

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:44.340
It's possible if one has dark magic.

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:46.060
Dark magic?

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:49.490
Dark magic is the sixth type of magic.

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:51.820
It's very dangerous, 
so it's forbidden to use,

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:53.330
and it's been kept hidden.

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:57.200
Only a few people 
in the entire country know about it.

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:59.730
A kind of magic 
that dangerous actually exists?

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:03.520
Dark magic can manipulate people's hearts,

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:07.080
and those it manipulates 
don't remember it afterward.

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:11.130
What a horrifying power...

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:12.760
Yes.

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:15.490
It amplifies emotions like envy 
and hatred in one's heart,

00:12:15.490 --> 00:12:17.400
and makes one act on them.

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:19.630
Envy and hatred...

00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:24.420
And since you don't possess such 
emotions, it wouldn't affect you.

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:28.000
That's why someone used it 
to manipulate those girls' hearts.

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:31.850
In other words, you might be their target.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:34.100
Me?! Why?!

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:35.620
I don't know.

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:38.020
We have no way of knowing 
who it was, either.

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:40.730
At any rate, please be 
as careful as possible.

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:44.680
Be sure you don't try to do
anything on your own.

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:46.370
All right...

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:52.230
<i>Wait... If I'm their target...</i>

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:55.520
Then why did Maria disappear?

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:57.300
She has nothing to do with this!

00:12:57.530 --> 00:13:01.160
Yes, but she has light magic.

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:04.190
Dark magic normally can't be detected,

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:07.780
but it's said that those with light magic 
are the only ones who can.

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:09.600
You mean...

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:13.290
After that incident, 
Miss Maria sensed something

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:15.230
and made contact with the perpetrator,

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:16.810
who then abducted her.

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:18.900
That is my deduction.

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:22.360
It can't be...

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:28.380
I can't believe people could 
be born with dark magic.

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:32.530
No, dark magic isn't something 
that anyone is born with.

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:35.170
It has to be acquired.

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:37.970
Acquired? How?

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:41.030
It requires a particular ritual.

00:13:41.030 --> 00:13:42.170
A ritual?

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:47.640
It can be acquired by offering 
a human life in a ritual.

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:49.240
In other words...

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:52.930
it's acquired in exchange 
for someone else's life.

00:13:58.750 --> 00:13:59.950
What is this place?

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:16.960
What happened to all of you?!

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:19.790
Wake up! Please, wake up!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.500
<i>Why... How...</i>

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.550
<i>If this was the ending 
that was waiting for me,</i>

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:29.760
<i>it would've been far better 
for me to be doomed alone!</i>

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:32.470
<i>Why?!</i>

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:37.250
A dream...

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:41.400
Because we were talking 
about dark magic before I went to sleep?

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:47.890
<i>It's acquired in exchange 
for someone else's life.</i>

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:52.840
<i>That future can't be real.</i>

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.970
<i>In the world of the game,</i>

00:14:54.970 --> 00:14:59.710
<i>the only one whose life was ever in danger 
was the villainess, Catarina Claes.</i>

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:06.500
Catarina
Dead or Exiled

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:06.500
Happy Ending

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:06.500
<b>Geordo Route</b>

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:06.500
Bad Ending

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:06.500
 Almost-criminal 
bullying of the heroine

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:06.500
Labeled a criminal
 and stripped of rank

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:06.500
Exiled

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:06.500
Tries to stab the 
heroine out of jealousy

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:06.500
Counterattacked by Geordo

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:06.500
Dies

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:03.830
<i>No matter which route you follow,</i>

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:05.950
<i>there's no way a future like that can exist.</i>

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:12.370
<i>And I've made so many preparations 
to help me overcome this kind of danger.</i>

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:15.540
<i>It's fine. It's going to be fine.</i>

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:23.190
Sister? You look pale.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.650
Good morning, Lady Catarina.

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:27.810
Morning...

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:30.490
Sister?!

00:15:38.550 --> 00:15:40.720
I slept so well.

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:44.310
<i>I didn't get much sleep 
last night after that dream.</i>

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:48.430
I feel much better now, ma'am.

00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:49.720
Thank you very much.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:51.580
That's good to hear.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:53.560
Are you going to head back to class?

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:54.300
Yes.

00:15:57.510 --> 00:16:02.380
<i>Geordo told me to make sure 
I didn't do anything alone,</i>

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:06.330
<i>but no one's around, 
and it's not that far. I'll be fine!</i>

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:16.930
<i>This is where Maria 
and I first became friends.</i>

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:20.790
<i>Maria...</i>

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:25.170
<i>I wonder where she is right now.</i>

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:27.950
<i>I hope she's not scared...</i>

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:30.210
<i>I hope she's not hungry...</i>

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:35.640
Oh? Miss Catarina?

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:39.840
What are you doing out here?

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.440
President...

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:47.930
Um, I didn't feel well, 
so I was resting in the doctor's office.

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:50.070
I'll be heading back 
to my classroom from here.

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:50.980
I see.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:53.810
But Miss Maria still hasn't been found,

00:16:53.810 --> 00:16:55.520
and it's dangerous for you to be alone.

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:56.820
Let me walk you back.

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:59.130
Thank you.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:05.810
<i>Wait... what is he doing out here?</i>

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:08.000
<i>Classes are in session right now...</i>

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:15.770
<i>His bright red hair and 
glittering gray eyes are so pretty.</i>

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:20.810
<i>There's one route that's really tough!</i>

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:23.000
There's a hidden character you can conquer,

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:26.260
but he's a dangerous guy who has dark magic!

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:27.520
Huh?!

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:32.370
If you fail to conquer him, 
he kills the protagonist and all of her friends!

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:34.230
It's a <i>super</i> bad ending!

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:35.280
That bad?!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:40.430
By the way, this hidden character 
has bright red hair and gray eyes—

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:42.640
Wait! Don't say any more!

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:44.310
No spoilers!

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:46.090
<i>That's it!</i>

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:49.580
<i>Acchan told me about 
the game's hidden character</i>

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:52.170
<i>and the ending that came with him!</i>

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:59.440
<i>How could I forget something 
so important for so long?!</i>

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:01.540
<i>I really am an idiot!</i>

00:18:02.130 --> 00:18:05.150
<i>The student council 
president, Sirius Dieke...</i>

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:08.770
<i>He's the hidden character from the game!</i>

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:15.530
<i>I can hardly believe that he would 
kill all the people I care about.</i>

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:18.250
<i>But if my memory 
from my past life is right,</i>

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:20.280
<i>he has dark magic.</i>

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:24.400
<i>The terrifying power gained 
in exchange for a human life...</i>

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:27.290
Miss Catarina? What's the matter?

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:32.520
<i>Is he... Is he really the one?</i>

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:39.450
Do you... have dark magic, President?

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:41.930
Did you use it to do something to Maria?

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:45.060
Dark magic?

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:48.470
<i>Oops! It slipped right out!</i>

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:51.750
What's that?

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:57.460
<i>Of course... You don't know 
what that is, right?</i>

00:18:57.460 --> 00:19:00.710
<i>I didn't know, either, until Geordo told me.</i>

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:03.650
<i>Maybe this reality is different 
from the game's setting.</i>

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:07.640
<i>My friends are different from 
the game characters in lots of ways, too.</i>

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:10.330
<i>There's a good chance 
the same goes for the president.</i>

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:14.080
There's no way a kind person like 
you could be behind it, is there?

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:18.960
President?

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:20.960
Kind, eh?

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:24.040
You say that about me quite often.

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:26.680
W-Well, you really are...

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:28.790
That's just an act.

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:32.320
It's easier to get by if I 
pretend to be a nice, quiet boy.

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:36.350
It looks like all of you 
idiots fell for it, though.

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:41.180
I'm the one who took Maria Campbell, too.

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:44.230
She learned something 
she didn't need to know.

00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:48.490
President, what is that?

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:54.250
Miss Maria? What's the matter?

00:19:54.350 --> 00:19:59.340
You're surrounded by the 
same black fog that I saw

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:02.130
when those girls besmirched Lady Catarina!

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:04.510
<i>She saw it?!</i>

00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:16.370
I should've expected that 
from one who has light magic.

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:20.020
You're right. I'm the one 
behind what happened.

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:22.700
All to get rid of that detestable girl.

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:27.840
But that's something you 
don't need to know about...

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:32.690
so you're going to forget everything.

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:35.580
Let go of me!

00:20:36.970 --> 00:20:38.680
<i>The dark magic isn't affecting her?!</i>

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:42.560
If you hurt Lady Catarina, 
I'll make you regret it!

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:45.010
Why would you want to—

00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:04.910
Catarina Claes, I absolutely hate you!

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:08.790
You reached out to those lonely guys thinking 
you were saving them, but you're a hypocrite!

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:11.460
Watching you irritates me to no end!

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:13.920
Just go off somewhere and disappear already!

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:17.930
<i>I don't understand what he's saying...</i>

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:22.000
<i>So, um... he really, really hates me,</i>

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:23.920
<i>he's the one who took Maria away,</i>

00:21:24.160 --> 00:21:29.650
<i>and he's the one who might kill 
all the people I care about soon...</i>

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:31.270
<i>And yet...</i>

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:36.670
Are you all right?

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:39.140
<i>He feels cold...</i>

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:44.680
<i>He looks like he's in such pain... 
such agony... that he could cry.</i>

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:49.080
Enough! Just leave me alone!

00:21:49.350 --> 00:21:52.320
Get out of my sight right now!

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:59.530
Huh? Everything's... dark...

00:22:01.230 --> 00:22:04.190
You can just stay asleep...

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:07.220
until your life runs out.
